      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree the stutters on the first load of groups or the shop have gotten worse since approximately VRChat 2026.2.2 or VRChat 2026.2.3, even on PCVR. Maybe the images should be lazy loaded sequentially.\n\nCheck the shown FPS from debug view in the attached video.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
